  "status": "present",
  "value": "The Fibonacci tree of order 0 is empty, of order 1 a single node, and of order n >= 2 a root whose left subtree has order n - 2 and right subtree order n - 1. Nodes of the order-n tree are labelled 0, 1, 2, ... in pre-order (root, left subtree, right subtree). Given n, startValue and destValue (valid labels), return the shortest step string from start to dest using \"U\" (to the parent), \"L\" (to the left child) and \"R\" (to the right child); \"\" when they are equal.",
